  "question": {
    "text": "The resultant of forces $\\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{P}}$ and $\\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{Q}}$ is $\\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{R}}$. If $\\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{Q}}$ is doubled then $\\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{R}}$ is doubled. If the direction of $\\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{Q}}$ is reversed, then $\\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{R}}$ is again doubled. Then $\\mathrm{P}^2: \\mathrm{Q}^2: \\mathrm{R}^2$ is",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "mesbd",
      "text": "\n$2: 3: 1$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "Cez4F",
      "text": "\n$3: 1: 1$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "HNl54",
      "text": "\n$2: 3: 2$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "GePe4",
      "text": "\n$1: 2: 3$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\mathrm{R}^2=\\mathrm{P}^2+\\mathrm{Q}^2+2 \\mathrm{PQ} \\cos \\theta$   <img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/PdScUAByTN7sn94K5p9Hc9cjEEXHW-PHjdKwLWiAfbY.original.fullsize.png\"><br>\n$4 \\mathrm{R}^2=\\mathrm{P}^2+4 \\mathrm{Q}^2+4 \\mathrm{PQ} \\cos \\theta$<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/_FHkg6ewJ3DFjGfjI4YVFBLaKuOk2buq4meeZBkdhPE.original.fullsize.png\"><br>\n$4 \\mathrm{R}^2=\\mathrm{P}^2+\\mathrm{Q}^2-2 \\mathrm{PQ} \\cos \\theta$<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/cPFJ9843Sj6Od3Amb5MDGrcBB_usOHPhHk4EE2gmesM.original.fullsize.png\"><br>\n$\\mathrm{On}(1)+(2), 5 \\mathrm{R}^2=2 \\mathrm{P}^2+2 \\mathrm{Q}^2$<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/wmg7jCNcZ0fokDgVXL2dsoQp-j9GOYlEMreClYYm2Pg.original.fullsize.png\"><br>\n$\\mathrm{On}(3) \\times 2+(2), 12 \\mathrm{R}^2=3 \\mathrm{P}^2+6 \\mathrm{Q}^2$<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/3qkvJk1g4i83h5QG7_9xDn_lDV3wd7haiWCJUWSzYBM.original.fullsize.png\"><br>\n$2 \\mathrm{P}^2+2 \\mathrm{Q}^2-5 \\mathrm{R}^2=0$<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/OQmuio8EOPK6elll3ZYLb31BjXLR9q89AOKAqY7N3p8.original.fullsize.png\"><br>\n$3 \\mathrm{P}^2+6 \\mathrm{Q}^2-12 \\mathrm{R}^2=0$<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/7NIW9RLHahH9SaJjL5yh6uyZ4jZsZMnBQsKEdk4H_QI.original.fullsize.png\"><br>\n$\\frac{\\mathrm{P}^2}{-24+30}=\\frac{\\mathrm{Q}^2}{24-15}=\\frac{\\mathrm{R}^2}{12-6}$\n$\\frac{\\mathrm{P}^2}{6}=\\frac{\\mathrm{Q}^2}{9}=\\frac{\\mathrm{R}^2}{6}$ or $\\mathrm{P}^2: \\mathrm{Q}^2: \\mathrm{R}^2=2: 3: 2$",
    "image": null
